This repository is a fork of fhshaik/typesafe-mario (https://github.com/fhshaik/typesafe-mario).
The emulator harness, the action set and the original RAM/telemetry state parser come from
upstream: src/typesafe_mario/state.py, actions.py, runner.py, dashboard.py, policy.py and cli.py
started as upstream files and have since been changed here (enemy table, floor profile, hidden
tiles, frame-cadence teacher, Adapt-1 hooks).

Adapt-1 / NeuroAdapt is a product of Rei Labs (https://docs.reilabs.org). This project is an
independent test of its public API and is not affiliated with Rei Labs.

